  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 390d48b7450cd4747b73af6494bb9519, type: 3}
  m_Name: Guide_LevelingPanelIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GuideDialogueSet
  lines:
  - RANK! The more you earn, the higher your rank.
  - More WEBSITES, better model, more money!
  - MOVEMENT SPEED! Use ARROW KEYS to move from side to side. Don't have time to
    be everywhere? Switch between sites faster.
  - Without MULTI-SALE, you won't get far! When you learn them, use ENTER!
  - Use BAN to get rid of annoying plebs (DOWN ARROW KEY).
  - If you succeed in everything, but feel that something is missing, just try ENLARGE.
